<p>Dealers ask two different questions: “Is my city open?” and “Which brand’s map am I on?” Those are not the same answer.</p>

<h2>WW Wood Products — 10 Western states</h2>
<p>Pinnacle represents <a href="/brands/shiloh-cabinetry/">Shiloh</a>, <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry/">Eclipse</a>, <a href="/brands/aspect-cabinetry/">Aspect</a>, and <a href="/brands/vistora-closets/">Vistora</a> across Arizona, California, Colorado, Idaho, Montana, Nevada, New Mexico, Oregon, Utah, and Washington — including mountain and resort markets. A Shiloh-only application is still a territory review. Openings change. We confirm what is available before you commit to a display. Custom shops and dealers leaving a box line: <a href="/guides/become-a-shiloh-dealer/">become a Shiloh dealer</a>.</p>

<h2>Pronorm — nationwide</h2>
<p><a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens/">Pronorm German Kitchens</a> are sold to qualified dealers in every state, with protected territories, through European Kitchen Distributors (EKD), a Pinnacle Sales company. You can open Pronorm without carrying the WW Wood lines. Spec notes for US rooms live on <a href="/guides/pronorm-american-depths/">Pronorm American depths</a>.</p>

<h2>US Stone</h2>
<p><a href="/brands/us-stone-group/">US Stone</a> is the sixth public brand — luxury surfaces next to the box. Distribution follows the Western map we already work. If you are a Pronorm-only dealer outside the West, ask on the call; do not assume a nationwide stone program.</p>

<h2>No locator</h2>
<p>This site does not list dealers and does not send homeowners to a store. Protection is a dealer conversation. <a href="/become-a-dealer/">Apply</a> and we will tell you what is open.</p>

</AeoGuide>
